 1236: ## 22. Settings contract
 1237: 
 1238: ### 22.1 Schema shape
 1239: 
 1240: `settings_schema()` returns a JSON-Schema subset object â€” `{"type": "object", "properties":
 1241: {...}, "required": [...]}` â€” exactly the shape shipped today
 1242: (`tts/providers/inworld/settings_schema.py`). Per-property keys: `type`
 1243: (`string|number|integer|boolean`), `label`, `description`, `default`, `minimum`, `maximum`,
 1244: `multipleOf`, `enum`, and `ui`.
 1245: 
 1246: ### 22.2 Widget vocabulary (frozen)
 1247: 
 1248: | `ui.type` | rendered today | source |
 1249: |---|---|---|
 1250: | *(absent)* | text input (or number input when `type` is numeric) | fallback |
 1251: | `password` | masked input, marked required | `ProviderSettingsForm.vue:30,138` |
 1252: | `dropdown` / `select` | select from `ui.options` (strings or `{value,label}`) | `:33-36,46-55` |
 1253: | `slider` | range using `minimum`/`maximum`/`multipleOf` | `:38-40,57-67` |
 1254: | `toggle` | checkbox | `:42-44` |
 1255: | `textarea` | **new** â€” multi-line text | owner 12.4 |
