 1269: ### 22.4 Dynamic options in provider settings (frozen)
 1270: 
 1271: `ui.options_source: {"source": "<allowlisted id>", "context": {...}}` resolves through the
 1272: same envelope as workflow node fields (Â§23). This is the mechanism that lets the Inworld voice
 1273: list appear in the provider modal without a Vue edit. `ui.options` and `ui.options_source` are
 1274: mutually exclusive; if both are present, `options_source` wins and a warning is recorded.
