 1283: Unknown keys in *saved* provider settings are **preserved and reported as a `warning`**, never
 1284: dropped. Today `put_provider_settings` merges anything with no check
 1285: (`editor/routes.py:400-401`); dropping would silently destroy configuration when a user rolls
 1286: back to an older provider version. Required-but-empty is an `error`; a hidden field (Â§22.3) is
 1287: exempt.
