 1397: ### 23.4 Caching and invalidation (frozen)
 1398: 
 1399: The current process-lifetime cache keyed by source alone (`_VALUE_CACHE`, `options.py:82`) is
 1400: wrong once options depend on settings. Frozen replacement:
 1401: 
 1402: - Cache key: `(source, tuple(sorted(normalized_context.items())))`.
 1403: - `cache="static"` â€” process lifetime, as today.
 1404: - `cache="discovery"` â€” invalidated on discovery and on dev reload.
 1405: - `cache="settings"` â€” TTL 300 s **and** explicitly invalidated on
 1406:   `PUT /api/providers/<domain>/<provider_id>/settings` and on a selection change (Â§24.2), for
 1407:   that domain only. Changing an API key must make the voice list refetch.
 1408: - Bounded: at most 64 entries per source, LRU eviction, so context parameters cannot grow the
 1409:   cache without limit.
