 1060: ### 20.2 `kind` semantics (frozen)
 1061: 
 1062: - `local` — runs in-process, no network (today: `kokoro`). May own heavy singletons; must
 1063:   implement `shutdown()`.
 1064: - `cloud` — outbound HTTPS to a third-party API with credentials in settings (today:
 1065:   `inworld`, `wavespeed_direct`, `kie_ai`).
