 1067:   (today `wavespeed_webhook` is declared `cloud`; 14.2 reclassifies it).
 1068: - `extension` — needs a browser extension and a WebSocket runtime; the **only** kind whose
 1069:   `register_runtime(app, sock)` is called at boot (`<domain>/providers/__init__.py:47-52`)
 1070:   (today: `gemini_ws`, `grok_automa`). The two WS URLs are frozen public surface (§17.1).
