 1211: **Exclusions become data, not just logs.** `ProviderRegistry.excluded() -> [{id, reason_code,
 1212: message}]` is new and is surfaced in `to_dict()` so the provider modal can show "3 providers
 1213: loaded, 1 excluded" instead of the current silent disappearance. `message` is truncated to
 1214: 200 characters, stripped to a basename if it contains a path, and passed through
 1215: structured redaction plus a generic exception sanitizer; `redact_settings` alone cannot remove
 1216: a secret embedded in an arbitrary exception string. Owner: **11.2**.
