 1330:   redacted value without overwriting the real one (rule: a field whose submitted value is
 1331:   exactly the redaction sentinel `"***"` is ignored on save).
 1332: - **Env vars are a read-time fallback, never a seed for secrets.** The registry resolves a
 1333:   value as `settings[key] or os.environ[manifest.environment[key]]`, and passes the resolved
 1334:   settings only to provider validation/health/invocation. The resolved value is never
 1335:   written back to `settings.json` and never returned. This replaces copying values in
 1336:   `_seed_from_env` (`settings_manager.py:85-104`). Owner: **11.3**.
