 1408: 
 1409: | condition | HTTP | code |
 1410: |---|---|---|
 1411: | unknown `<source>` | 404 | `NOT_FOUND` (unchanged, `routes.py:200`) |
 1412: | context parameter invalid, unknown domain/provider, or fails sanitization | 400 | `OPTION_CONTEXT_INVALID` |
 1413: | resolver raised — provider unreachable, model missing, extension offline | 503 | `PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE` (unchanged, `routes.py:198`) |
