 1419: **Save-time validation still fails open.** `allowed_option_values` (`options.py:85-105`)
 1420: becomes context-aware but keeps its contract from step 6.3: a bad value is rejected, an
 1421: unavailable resolver returns `None` and never blocks saving an otherwise-valid workflow. A
 1422: context-sensitive value is checked against the canonical provider saved in that same node
 1423: configuration (or the selected provider only when the node has no provider field). It is not
 1424: validated against a union across providers: that would accept an Inworld-only voice for a
 1425: Kokoro node and defer a deterministic configuration error until execution. Existing workflows
 1426: remain stable because their saved provider wins over the global selection (§24.1).
